t-code (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Much less memory and CPU: editors start when their tab is first shown,
    hidden editors stay idle, clangd runs with two malloc arenas, the Markdown
    preview's network process exits with the last preview.
  * Opening t-code no longer flashes clipboard windows or clears the clipboard.
  * Tests for the shared language servers, including a heap growth check.

